{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n萬眾期待的樊亦敏（Amy）及歐瑞偉（KC）終於「回家」，將於下周一（26日）播出的TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》「龔喜駕到」中隆重登場！劇組率先發布二人劇中造型，單是頭兩集，每人就至少有6至7個造型，心思十足，究竟他們會以怎樣的破格形象示人？\n</p>\n<h2>歐瑞偉化身百變保鏢 連群姐份工都撈埋？</h2>\n<p>劇中KC為了配合「百變保鏢」的身份，造型千變萬化，一口氣化身成官仔骨骨的西裝友、滿身油漆的油漆工、勤奮的掃地工、茶記伙計、快遞員，甚至是街市賣魚小販，充滿「換」味。一系列貼地又搞笑的造型曝光後，引來大批《愛‧回家》粉絲熱烈討論，紛紛表示非常期待，更有人笑言「未見過笑得咁開心的茶記伙記」，甚至開玩笑指KC連群姐（許思敏飾）的清潔工作都撈過界，可見其角色可塑性極高。</p>\n<h2>樊亦敏豹紋Look登場 自抽蟐蛾造型勁搶鏡</h2>\n<p>至於Amy樊亦敏的「變裝」同樣驚喜十足，完全符合其角色的浮誇樂觀人設。在率先曝光的造型中，最搶鏡的莫過於「自抽味」極濃的蟐蛾Look，玩味十足。此外，她還有一個野性味濃的豹紋熟女Look，散發成熟魅力。配搭顏色鮮豔奪目的扮Young運動Look作為日常打扮，多變的形象定必能為觀眾帶來強烈的官能刺激，令人期待她在劇中的演出。</p>\n<h2>劇組預告神秘霸氣造型 樊亦敏車婉婉大跳見面舞</h2>\n<p>除了已曝光的造型，據知劇組為了配合Amy的隆重登場，更特別為她打造了一個前所未見的霸氣神秘造型，細節將於稍後公布，為角色增添不少神秘感。在劇情方面，飾演車婉婉中學同學的樊亦敏，將會與婉婉有大量對手戲，二人不但會大跳趣怪的「見面舞」，更會齊齊在街頭busking，互動火花四濺，絕對不容錯過。</p>\n<h2>粉絲大嗌期待：未見過笑得咁開心嘅茶記伙記！</h2>\n<p>對於樊亦敏和歐瑞偉強勢加盟，網民反應極為熱烈，紛紛湧入討論區留言。大部分粉絲都表示引頸以待，留言洗版式大讚：「KC啲造型好正，連群姐份工都撈埋，笑死！」、「好期待Amy同KC呢對組合，一定勁有火花！」、「終於等到佢哋返嚟喇，回憶返哂黎！」、「未見過笑得咁開心的茶記伙記，KC好可愛！」、「Amy個蟐蛾look係咪自抽？太好笑！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_5554516556adaf40065b42.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_5554516556adaf40065b42.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_2989699896adaf40d0a058.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_2989699896adaf40d0a058.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_12126675026adaf42161e0c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_12126675026adaf42161e0c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_8747962556adaf42e46d0f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_8747962556adaf42e46d0f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_7226149766adaf43ccbbf4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_7226149766adaf43ccbbf4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_19851108356adaf440981b4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_19851108356adaf440981b4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_12579668916adaf4577d27d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_12579668916adaf4577d27d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_17191270396adaf471f38b9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_17191270396adaf471f38b9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_14387039866adaf48e1515c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_14387039866adaf48e1515c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_12911590916adaf498e3c1b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/23_12911590916adaf498e3c1b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_7578301976adaf4a5d6082.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/24_7578301976adaf4a5d6082.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_17338755566adaf4b40bc69.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_17338755566adaf4b40bc69.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_3477594916adaf4bebae9d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_3477594916adaf4bebae9d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.468825+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1224,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:31.313679+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:31.313679+00:00","content_hash":"1e6a49ea05042fd44be4a66327a6d70919494dbdf8fece54eac5f15035b8c791","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}